the full solution set covering all questions, and for Q3 I need a DFA tracking the count of 'b's seen (0, 1, 2, or 3+) combined with whether at least one 'a' has occurred.\n\nAdding transition table...\n\nThat completes the DFA design with 7 states total. Now I'll write up the full solutions in the artifact.","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"C:/Users/tanus/.gemini/antigravity/brain/a2d53718-58c1-49c0-9cb0-9ac51d4c37cc/.user_uploaded/media_1788625466528.png","toolAction":"Reading question paper page 1","toolSummary":"Question paper page 1"}},{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"C:/Users/tanus/.gemini/antigravity/brain/a2d53718-58c1-49c0-9cb0-9ac51d4c37cc/.user_uploaded/media_1788625480659.png","toolAction":"Reading question paper page 2","toolSummary":"Question paper page 2"}}]}
