{"step_index":54,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-05T16:31:36Z","content":"Here's a quick summary of every solution:\n\n---\n\n### Q1a — String count over Σ={x,y,z}\nStrings of length 0 + 1 + 2 = **1 + 3 + 9 = 13**\n\n### Q1b — Prefixes/Suffixes of \"abaabbab\" (up to length 3)\n- **Prefixes:** ε, a, ab, aba\n- **Suffixes:** ε, b, ab, bab\n\n### Q2 — L1·L2\\* ∪ L3\\*\nL1·L2\\* = {ε}·a\\* = **a\\*** | L3\\* = ∅\\* = {ε} ⊆ a\\* → Answer: **a\\***\n\n### Q3 — DFA (≥1 'a' AND exactly 2 'b's)\n**7 states** — track (b-count × has-a?) as a 2D state space. Only **q₂₁** (2 b's seen, ≥1 a seen) is accepting.\n\n### Q4 — NFA (3rd from right = 'a')\n**4 states** — q₀ loops on a,b and non-deterministically branches to q₁ on 'a'; q₁→q₂→q₃(accept) reads exactly 2 more symbols.\n\n### Q5 (Page 1) — DFA Minimization\nMark algorithm finds: **C≡D**, **E≡F**, **A≡B** → Original 6 states collapse to **3 states**: P={A,B}, Q={C,D}, R={E,F}\n\n### Q5 (Page 2) — ε-NFA → DFA\nSubset construction gives **7 DFA states** (A,B,C non-accepting; D,E,F,G accepting). Language = **(0+1)\\*(00+11)(0+1)\\***\n\n### Q6a — Mealy Machine (A/B/C outputs)\n**2 states**: q₀ (last='0'), q₁ (last='1'). Output A on q₁+0, B on q₁+1, C everywhere else.\n\n### Q6b — Mealy → Moore Conversion\nq₃ receives both z₁ and z₂ outputs → splits into **q₃ᴬ** (output z₁) and **q₃ᴮ** (output z₂). Final Moore machine has **4 states**."}
